<a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/05/05/iphone-18-downgrades-rumored-yet-again/">Most recently</a>, the leaker said certain parts are interchangeable between the &zwnj;iPhone 18&zwnj; and the lower-cost iPhone 18e, indicating that some specification convergence between the two devices is real and measurable at the supply chain level. "Take it from me: The standard &zwnj;iPhone 18&zwnj; model has been downgraded and its launch delayed-this decision is final and will not change," they added.<br/>
